    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wizard-themed character creator that generates a silly madlibs-style backstory based on your choices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 Customize your wizard\u2019s appearance, apparel, and give them magical accessories!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc\u00a0 Learn about your wizard, where they came from, how they gained their skillz, and the story behind their title!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3d Shares the same universe as WYRMHALL: Brush and Banter!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc2d\u00a0</strong>Playable with just a mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's it!</p></li></ul>",
